Summary:
Today’s session provided an introduction to full stack development, explaining the overall workflow and how frontend and backend technologies work together. The session began with a revision of React concepts to strengthen frontend understanding before moving ahead. Key ideas about application structure and data flow were discussed. This helped in building a foundation for full stack learning.
Outcomes:
By the end of the session, we gained clarity on the role of React in frontend development within a full stack application. We refreshed core React concepts and understood how they connect to backend services. The session prepared us for upcoming backend technologies. Overall, it helped in visualizing the complete development process from frontend to backend.
